{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10036","headline":"感寓二首 二 · 梁德裕","name":"感寓二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽涧生蕙若，幽渚老江蓠。\n荣落人不见，芳香徒尔爲。\n不及绿萍草，生君红莲池。\n左右美人弄，朝夕春风吹。\n叶洗玉泉水，珠清湛露滋。\n心亦愿如此，托君君不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}